(615885, 63948, 10943, '<td valign="top">I really like this one....very nice.  8</td>', 'I really like this one....very nice.  8', '2004-03-10 00:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(615887, 63802, 7350, '<td valign="top">The lighting doesn''t seem to bring out your image very well.</td>', 'The lighting doesn''t seem to bring out your image very well.', '2004-03-10 00:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(615889, 63933, 10943, '<td valign="top">Wouldn''t wanna get near that baby...</td>', 'Wouldn''t wanna get near that baby...', '2004-03-10 00:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(615890, 63798, 15768, '<td valign="top">horrible border, nice picture.</td>', 'horrible border, nice picture.', '2004-03-10 00:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(615891, 63930, 7350, '<td valign="top">What is he expecting off-screen here?  Unfortunately, the lack of contrast in the statues takes up most of your image.</td>', 'What is he expecting off-screen here?  Unfortunately, the lack of contrast in the statues takes up most of your image.', '2004-03-10 00:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(615892, 63535, 10943, '<td valign="top">Neat</td>', 'Neat', '2004-03-10 00:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(615893, 63731, 17037, '<td valign="top">Can''t go wrong with a beautiful dog.  Very nice and I like the use of black and white.</td>', 'Can''t go wrong with a beautiful dog.  Very nice and I like the use of black and white.', '2004-03-10 00:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(615894, 63317, 7350, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand what the off-screen expectation is here.  Also, the shadows and blown-out highlights of this shot are distracting.</td>', 'I don''t understand what the off-screen expectation is here.  Also, the shadows and blown-out highlights of this shot are distracting.', '2004-03-10 00:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(615895, 63983, 7350, '<td valign="top">The graininess and lighting are perfect here - they seem to convey the message of your shot very well.</td>', 'The graininess and lighting are perfect here - they seem to convey the message of your shot very well.', '2004-03-10 00:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(615897, 63137, 7350, '<td valign="top">Focus, lighting, and noise problems.  To me, this is an uninteresting shot.</td>', 'Focus, lighting, and noise problems.  To me, this is an uninteresting shot.', '2004-03-10 00:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(615898, 63653, 7350, '<td valign="top">The B/W conversion here is very well done.  Also, I think the somewhat random background really presents the mood of the bride well.  Is she laughing or throwing up?  Nicely done.</td>', 'The B/W conversion here is very well done.  Also, I think the somewhat random background really presents the mood of the bride well.  Is she laughing or throwing up?  Nicely done.', '2004-03-10 00:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(615899, 63921, 7350, '<td valign="top">I really like the cropping of this shot.  Also, the lighting really gives this shot a mood.  Nice!</td>', 'I really like the cropping of this shot.  Also, the lighting really gives this shot a mood.  Nice!', '2004-03-10 00:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(615900, 63943, 17550, '<td valign="top">Creative!</td>', 'Creative!', '2004-03-10 00:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(615902, 63575, 7350, '<td valign="top">This is sick.  I won''t vote based on the subject matter, though I find it tasteless.  I do think that the background is blown out enough to blend in with your subject a little too much on the left side.</td>', 'This is sick.  I won''t vote based on the subject matter, though I find it tasteless.  I do think that the background is blown out enough to blend in with your subject a little too much on the left side.', '2004-03-10 00:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(615904, 63242, 7350, '<td valign="top">Nothing appears to be "expected" off-screen here.  Also, this image is too small to really see details.</td>', 'Nothing appears to be "expected" off-screen here.  Also, this image is too small to really see details.', '2004-03-10 00:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(615909, 63237, 7350, '<td valign="top">Wonderful.  The staging of the shot is fantastic, and I love the obvious use of venitian blinds here.  The expresion on the model''s face is priceless!  9.</td>', 'Wonderful.  The staging of the shot is fantastic, and I love the obvious use of venitian blinds here.  The expresion on the model''s face is priceless!  9.', '2004-03-10 00:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(615911, 63830, 10943, '<td valign="top">Nice work...7</td>', 'Nice work...7', '2004-03-10 00:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(615912, 63600, 17037, '<td valign="top">A tight crop around the woman and her daughter would have been MUCH stronger.</td>', 'A tight crop around the woman and her daughter would have been MUCH stronger.', '2004-03-10 00:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(615913, 63891, 7350, '<td valign="top">I really like the contrast presented here.  Also, the composition seems to give your subject plenty of moving room.  Well done.</td>', 'I really like the contrast presented here.  Also, the composition seems to give your subject plenty of moving room.  Well done.', '2004-03-10 00:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(615915, 63786, 10943, '<td valign="top">Great pic! 8</td>', 'Great pic! 8', '2004-03-10 00:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(615916, 63455, 7350, '<td valign="top">Honestly, I think this composition could have done without the candle at the bottom at all.  It is quite distracting.  I would rather wonder what the fuse was connected to, without wondering why we have a smoldering candle.</td>', 'Honestly, I think this composition could have done without the candle at the bottom at all.  It is quite distracting.  I would rather wonder what the fuse was connected to, without wondering why we have a smoldering candle.', '2004-03-10 00:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(615917, 63672, 10943, '<td valign="top">Cute!</td>', 'Cute!', '2004-03-10 00:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(615921, 63283, 7350, '<td valign="top">The expression is fantastic, but the lighting is poor.  Also, the background is very distracting.  This seems very much like a "snapshot," by which I mean you have given little thought to the details of the shot.</td>', 'The expression is fantastic, but the lighting is poor.  Also, the background is very distracting.  This seems very much like a "snapshot," by which I mean you have given little thought to the details of the shot.', '2004-03-10 00:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(615923, 63987, 10943, '<td valign="top">Now that''s abstract...interesting. :)</td>', 'Now that''s abstract...interesting. :)', '2004-03-10 00:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(615924, 63345, 9763, '<td valign="top">what is this?  What is the offscreen expectation?</td>', 'what is this?  What is the offscreen expectation?', '2004-03-10 00:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(615925, 63913, 7350, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand what the "off-screen" expectation is here.  Also, the colors are very drab.</td>', 'I don''t understand what the "off-screen" expectation is here.  Also, the colors are very drab.', '2004-03-10 00:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(615927, 63882, 9763, '<td valign="top">Cute, but photo quality is not too great</td>', 'Cute, but photo quality is not too great', '2004-03-10 00:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(615929, 63959, 14606, '<td valign="top">I''ve been through most of the entries and had to come back to this one to comment.  i think this shot shows the kind of creativity that is lacking in most of the other entries.  i hope you place in the top 3 with this one.  mildly comic, yet very tense.  i love it</td>', 'I''ve been through most of the entries and had to come back to this one to comment.  i think this shot shows the kind of creativity that is lacking in most of the other entries.  i hope you place in the top 3 with this one.  mildly comic, yet very tense.  i love it', '2004-03-10 00:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(615930, 63351, 7350, '<td valign="top">I think this strange post-processing job works pretty well here.  I bet you''re gonna get killed in the voting from all the anti-photoshop crowd!  7.</td>', 'I think this strange post-processing job works pretty well here.  I bet you''re gonna get killed in the voting from all the anti-photoshop crowd!  7.', '2004-03-10 00:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(615931, 63990, 7350, '<td valign="top">The lighting has left your shot quite flat.  Perhaps a little contrast boost could help.</td>', 'The lighting has left your shot quite flat.  Perhaps a little contrast boost could help.', '2004-03-10 00:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(615933, 63955, 7350, '<td valign="top">Your idea is wonderful, and you have done well with the symmetry.  Your focal plane is well placed, and I like that you have a relatively narrow depth of field.  If I had to complain about something, I would have liked to see just a little more of the fuse fire at the top.  Regardless, 10 from me.</td>', 'Your idea is wonderful, and you have done well with the symmetry.  Your focal plane is well placed, and I like that you have a relatively narrow depth of field.  If I had to complain about something, I would have liked to see just a little more of the fuse fire at the top.  Regardless, 10 from me.', '2004-03-10 00:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(615934, 63867, 17550, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot!!!!</td>', 'Beautiful shot!!!!', '2004-03-10 00:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(615935, 63880, 7350, '<td valign="top">Nice B/W, nice contrast.</td>', 'Nice B/W, nice contrast.', '2004-03-10 00:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(615936, 63469, 7350, '<td valign="top">I really like your toning and lighting in this shot.  The expression on his face looks a little unnatural. 8.</td>', 'I really like your toning and lighting in this shot.  The expression on his face looks a little unnatural. 8.', '2004-03-10 00:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(615937, 63869, 10943, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. 7</td>', 'Nice shot. 7', '2004-03-10 00:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(615938, 63848, 9763, '<td valign="top">cute subject, low photo quality</td>', 'cute subject, low photo quality', '2004-03-10 00:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(615939, 63767, 7350, '<td valign="top">You have given little thought to background, lighting, or focal plane here.  That makes this just another picture of someone else''s kid to me.</td>', 'You have given little thought to background, lighting, or focal plane here.  That makes this just another picture of someone else''s kid to me.', '2004-03-10 00:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(615940, 63586, 10943, '<td valign="top">Great shot -- I llike the suspense it captures...8</td>', 'Great shot -- I llike the suspense it captures...8', '2004-03-10 00:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(615941, 63453, 7350, '<td valign="top">I love the small-town newpaper feel of this shot.  All of your models'' expressions seem to corrolate.  The B/W is perfect, and the contrast is very nice.  10.</td>', 'I love the small-town newpaper feel of this shot.  All of your models'' expressions seem to corrolate.  The B/W is perfect, and the contrast is very nice.  10.', '2004-03-10 00:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(615942, 63882, 7350, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but some highlights are blown out, and the person''s foot seems to lack contrast.</td>', 'Nice idea, but some highlights are blown out, and the person''s foot seems to lack contrast.', '2004-03-10 00:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(615944, 63553, 7350, '<td valign="top">Here is a simple snapshot that you have processed into a great photo.  Nice cropping, nice toning.  8.</td>', 'Here is a simple snapshot that you have processed into a great photo.  Nice cropping, nice toning.  8.', '2004-03-10 00:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(615945, 63927, 10943, '<td valign="top">Whoa</td>', 'Whoa', '2004-03-10 00:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(615948, 63622, 7350, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but I wish I could tell what that background is.  Snow?</td>', 'Good idea, but I wish I could tell what that background is.  Snow?', '2004-03-10 00:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(615949, 63795, 10943, '<td valign="top">Great color! 8</td>', 'Great color! 8', '2004-03-10 00:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(615950, 63361, 7350, '<td valign="top">A good idea, but a huge portion of your shot is used up trying to indicate to me what the intended subject is.  That seems to ruin it for me.</td>', 'A good idea, but a huge portion of your shot is used up trying to indicate to me what the intended subject is.  That seems to ruin it for me.', '2004-03-10 00:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(615952, 63962, 7350, '<td valign="top">While this seems to slightly meet the challenge, it doesn''t express the theme well.  Also, the colors and contrast are a little drab - possibly due to the light through the clouds.</td>', 'While this seems to slightly meet the challenge, it doesn''t express the theme well.  Also, the colors and contrast are a little drab - possibly due to the light through the clouds.', '2004-03-10 00:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(615953, 63912, 7350, '<td valign="top">Very well done.  Nice blurring of the background, nice composition.  10.</td>', 'Very well done.  Nice blurring of the background, nice composition.  10.', '2004-03-10 00:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(615955, 63869, 9763, '<td valign="top">Cute kitty.  The background is clearer than the cat though :(</td>', 'Cute kitty.  The background is clearer than the cat though :(', '2004-03-10 00:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(615956, 63373, 10943, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, constrast and focus. :)  8</td>', 'Nice colors, constrast and focus. :)  8', '2004-03-10 00:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(615957, 63840, 7350, '<td valign="top">That one on the line - is it in or is it out?  This photo doesn''t grab me.</td>', 'That one on the line - is it in or is it out?  This photo doesn''t grab me.', '2004-03-10 00:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(615958, 63890, 7350, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of B/W.  I also like your crop - I''m glad the model''s legs are included, because it really enhances the "theme."  Nice work.</td>', 'Nice choice of B/W.  I also like your crop - I''m glad the model''s legs are included, because it really enhances the "theme."  Nice work.', '2004-03-10 00:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(615959, 63798, 7350, '<td valign="top">My primary complaint on this shot would be the darkness on the bottom of the scoop of ice cream that''s still in the scooper.</td>', 'My primary complaint on this shot would be the darkness on the bottom of the scoop of ice cream that''s still in the scooper.', '2004-03-10 00:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(615960, 63867, 7350, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea.  I don''t think the white border is necessary, but the image more than makes up for it.  Nice use of negative space. 8.</td>', 'Excellent idea.  I don''t think the white border is necessary, but the image more than makes up for it.  Nice use of negative space. 8.', '2004-03-10 00:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(615962, 63787, 10943, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s a great pic!  I love the colors.  Nice off-screen expectation. ;)  9</td>', 'Wow, that''s a great pic!  I love the colors.  Nice off-screen expectation. ;)  9', '2004-03-10 00:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(615963, 63732, 7350, '<td valign="top">Wow, how did you do that shadow?  It looks like a character out of the "Far Side" comics.  Well done.  8.</td>', 'Wow, how did you do that shadow?  It looks like a character out of the "Far Side" comics.  Well done.  8.', '2004-03-10 00:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(615964, 63863, 10943, '<td valign="top">Cute!</td>', 'Cute!', '2004-03-10 00:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(615966, 63814, 7350, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, nice idea.  Heartbreaking!</td>', 'Nice colors, nice idea.  Heartbreaking!', '2004-03-10 00:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(615967, 63880, 15934, '<td valign="top">Sexy image.  Maybe you could have moved the model away from the backdrop to avoid the shadows.</td>', 'Sexy image.  Maybe you could have moved the model away from the backdrop to avoid the shadows.', '2004-03-10 00:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(615968, 63839, 7350, '<td valign="top">This shot leaves nothing to be expected off-screen.  Seeing the date left on, I''m wondering if you just submitted this for shock factor.  2.</td>', 'This shot leaves nothing to be expected off-screen.  Seeing the date left on, I''m wondering if you just submitted this for shock factor.  2.', '2004-03-10 00:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(615969, 63714, 7350, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, nice contrast.  8.</td>', 'Nice colors, nice contrast.  8.', '2004-03-10 00:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
