(616144, 63900, 16929, '<td valign="top">This is one of those shots... kind of like when you see a commercial of a kid getting hit by a car, but you don''t see the kid actually get hit, but you feel the kid getting hit.  Ok.. that was a horribly constructed sentence, but this photo is composed, exposed, and executed nicely. Color balance is a bit off, isnt it?  Maybe the background is throwing me off.... 8</td>', 'This is one of those shots... kind of like when you see a commercial of a kid getting hit by a car, but you don''t see the kid actually get hit, but you feel the kid getting hit.  Ok.. that was a horribly constructed sentence, but this photo is composed, exposed, and executed nicely. Color balance is a bit off, isnt it?  Maybe the background is throwing me off.... 8', '2004-03-10 03:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(616145, 63936, 16929, '<td valign="top">They both look like chicks! JK! The title helps me understand this photo.  It shows the male looking a bit entertained, and the female grimacing.  The lamp''s reflection threw your exposure off a bit, but a great idea....</td>', 'They both look like chicks! JK! The title helps me understand this photo.  It shows the male looking a bit entertained, and the female grimacing.  The lamp''s reflection threw your exposure off a bit, but a great idea....', '2004-03-10 03:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(616146, 63672, 16929, '<td valign="top">Wow. That use of blue really makes this shine.  The collar got a bit washed out on the right.. but the blue in the eyes are just subtle enough to not lose the effect. This is cool. 7</td>', 'Wow. That use of blue really makes this shine.  The collar got a bit washed out on the right.. but the blue in the eyes are just subtle enough to not lose the effect. This is cool. 7', '2004-03-10 03:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(616148, 63863, 4008, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge, but not a very appealing image. The light is really flat, the environment is very sterile, uninteresting, the pose of the dog is nothing special, there is a strong shadow behind the head caused by the flash. I would suggest to give more thought to environment and light, for example have the dog stand against a desk or table, looking for food, while you have some props around where you show you are preparing your own.</td>', 'Meets the challenge, but not a very appealing image. The light is really flat, the environment is very sterile, uninteresting, the pose of the dog is nothing special, there is a strong shadow behind the head caused by the flash. I would suggest to give more thought to environment and light, for example have the dog stand against a desk or table, looking for food, while you have some props around where you show you are preparing your own.', '2004-03-10 03:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(616149, 63775, 16929, '<td valign="top">I hated losing balloons as a kid.  I get the message here.  Lots of color, maybe more contrast and sharpness.6</td>', 'I hated losing balloons as a kid.  I get the message here.  Lots of color, maybe more contrast and sharpness.6', '2004-03-10 03:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(616150, 63266, 16929, '<td valign="top">This picture really makes me think.. "what is that guy thinking about??" Is he looking at punk kids?  Is he looking at an overly-friendly couple in public? This is cool, and it grows on me as I look at it more.... for some reason, the lock on the table and chair add something to the photo.. maybe an idea of the kind of neighborhood this was taken in. 8</td>', 'This picture really makes me think.. "what is that guy thinking about??" Is he looking at punk kids?  Is he looking at an overly-friendly couple in public? This is cool, and it grows on me as I look at it more.... for some reason, the lock on the table and chair add something to the photo.. maybe an idea of the kind of neighborhood this was taken in. 8', '2004-03-10 03:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(616151, 63468, 16929, '<td valign="top">Cool. Great use of the shadow to help us what to expect.  Maybe a bit better exposure on legs.. i like this though.</td>', 'Cool. Great use of the shadow to help us what to expect.  Maybe a bit better exposure on legs.. i like this though.', '2004-03-10 03:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(616152, 63585, 4008, '<td valign="top">There is something off-screen but I have no idea what it is. There is no expression on the face to indicate a certain feeling to me. Technically the picture is fine, exposure, sharpness etc., although I  would have cropped out the light at the bottom border and the darker spot at the right border.</td>', 'There is something off-screen but I have no idea what it is. There is no expression on the face to indicate a certain feeling to me. Technically the picture is fine, exposure, sharpness etc., although I  would have cropped out the light at the bottom border and the darker spot at the right border.', '2004-03-10 03:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(616153, 63871, 16929, '<td valign="top">If his back was arched more, and leaning more... it would have been more powerful to me. Great idea, nice shot. 6</td>', 'If his back was arched more, and leaning more... it would have been more powerful to me. Great idea, nice shot. 6', '2004-03-10 03:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(616154, 63837, 16929, '<td valign="top">WIth better exposure, this image could have been powerful. 5<br/></td>', 'WIth better exposure, this image could have been powerful. 5', '2004-03-10 03:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
