(616174, 63912, 16957, '<td valign="top">I see the point but the challenge is to imply something happening past the edge of the frame. Happenign implies dynamism. However, maybe that''s just my interpretation. it''s a nicely composed shot with excellent lighting and texture.</td>', 'I see the point but the challenge is to imply something happening past the edge of the frame. Happenign implies dynamism. However, maybe that''s just my interpretation. it''s a nicely composed shot with excellent lighting and texture.', '2004-03-10 04:38:50.000000', NULL, 1);
