(616228, 63865, 16672, '<td valign="top">What does this eye have to do with lingerie? It looks more like the person in the reflection is actually about to shoot the person with eye with some sort of a gun. I know its a camera but the angle and lack of details looks like it could be a shot gun up close and personal.</td>', 'What does this eye have to do with lingerie? It looks more like the person in the reflection is actually about to shoot the person with eye with some sort of a gun. I know its a camera but the angle and lack of details looks like it could be a shot gun up close and personal.', '2004-03-10 05:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
