(616248, 63653, 15420, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot.  The photo doesn''t seem to convey the intended meaning without the caption</td>', 'Lovely shot.  The photo doesn''t seem to convey the intended meaning without the caption', '2004-03-10 06:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(616249, 63993, 17191, '<td valign="top">Really captured the moment</td>', 'Really captured the moment', '2004-03-10 06:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(616250, 63842, 16957, '<td valign="top">A nicely composed shot. However there is little implication of anything happening past the edge of the frame - the attention is drawn to the girl''s face - that''s where things are happening. Then i think well yes she''s is so obviously anticipating the rest of the slide so perhaps this is cleverer than I thought!</td>', 'A nicely composed shot. However there is little implication of anything happening past the edge of the frame - the attention is drawn to the girl''s face - that''s where things are happening. Then i think well yes she''s is so obviously anticipating the rest of the slide so perhaps this is cleverer than I thought!', '2004-03-10 06:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(616251, 63586, 17191, '<td valign="top">Spot the ball!!!!</td>', 'Spot the ball!!!!', '2004-03-10 06:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(616253, 63954, 13169, '<td valign="top">Only the title here says anything about "expectation", sorry.  Feels like a pic taken and then forced into the challenge so it could be used.  Otherwise, excellent photo.</td>', 'Only the title here says anything about "expectation", sorry.  Feels like a pic taken and then forced into the challenge so it could be used.  Otherwise, excellent photo.', '2004-03-10 06:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(616254, 63641, 16957, '<td valign="top">I like this - very creative. I guess this was fairly opportunistic but there woudl be ways of improving here. First the birds are indistinct against their background - a lower angle would enmphasise the sense of flight. the foregoround is out of focus - given that this is where the off-screen action is (the disturbance) this might be better in focus. finally, there''s a sense of chaos in the images of the birds -which is distracting. A smaller flock would have helped. Well done.</td>', 'I like this - very creative. I guess this was fairly opportunistic but there woudl be ways of improving here. First the birds are indistinct against their background - a lower angle would enmphasise the sense of flight. the foregoround is out of focus - given that this is where the off-screen action is (the disturbance) this might be better in focus. finally, there''s a sense of chaos in the images of the birds -which is distracting. A smaller flock would have helped. Well done.', '2004-03-10 06:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(616255, 63842, 17191, '<td valign="top">You can feel the anticipation in this. Cool.</td>', 'You can feel the anticipation in this. Cool.', '2004-03-10 06:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(616256, 63955, 17191, '<td valign="top">Great idea!</td>', 'Great idea!', '2004-03-10 06:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
