(616582, 63837, 13136, '<td valign="top">Expectation is shown well here. Unfortunately, the darkness and distance to the subjects makes this less interesting. Good lack of motion capture in a low light situation.</td>', 'Expectation is shown well here. Unfortunately, the darkness and distance to the subjects makes this less interesting. Good lack of motion capture in a low light situation.', '2004-03-10 10:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(616587, 63880, 13136, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Good composition and contrast. But it doesn''t really show someone expecting something that is off-screen. It''s the viewer of the photo that is expecting. Hmm. maybe that works too.</td>', 'Nice shot. Good composition and contrast. But it doesn''t really show someone expecting something that is off-screen. It''s the viewer of the photo that is expecting. Hmm. maybe that works too.', '2004-03-10 10:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(616588, 63864, 16318, '<td valign="top">compelling image!!</td>', 'compelling image!!', '2004-03-10 10:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(616589, 63332, 13136, '<td valign="top">Somehow you managed to get everything mostly in focus. Good job of that. the only thing I can think is maybe not shooting this from so directly overhead. It''s hard to be sure if the dog is up on it''s hind feet. Makes me feel like I have to study the picture for that instead of just enjoying it.</td>', 'Somehow you managed to get everything mostly in focus. Good job of that. the only thing I can think is maybe not shooting this from so directly overhead. It''s hard to be sure if the dog is up on it''s hind feet. Makes me feel like I have to study the picture for that instead of just enjoying it.', '2004-03-10 10:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(616592, 63552, 15919, '<td valign="top">Magnificant capture of the cloud.  Do you use polarizing filter?</td>', 'Magnificant capture of the cloud.  Do you use polarizing filter?', '2004-03-10 10:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(616593, 63404, 13136, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid I don''t see the off-screen part of this shot. I assume the expectation is to eat the cake. Not a real interesting shot, especially with the bright reflection off the out-of-focus red spot.</td>', 'I''m afraid I don''t see the off-screen part of this shot. I assume the expectation is to eat the cake. Not a real interesting shot, especially with the bright reflection off the out-of-focus red spot.', '2004-03-10 10:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(616594, 63334, 13136, '<td valign="top">Pretty flower shot. Unfortunately, there is nothing in this shot that tells me the flower is expecting anything. Only the title gives a hint on that.</td>', 'Pretty flower shot. Unfortunately, there is nothing in this shot that tells me the flower is expecting anything. Only the title gives a hint on that.', '2004-03-10 10:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(616596, 63749, 13136, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. Unfortunately it tells me that the man is sitting there contemplating, not expecting something we can''t see.</td>', 'Interesting shot. Unfortunately it tells me that the man is sitting there contemplating, not expecting something we can''t see.', '2004-03-10 10:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(616597, 63351, 16318, '<td valign="top">is that basic editing?</td>', 'is that basic editing?', '2004-03-10 10:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(616599, 63182, 13136, '<td valign="top">Good closeup. Unfortunately he looks like he is just relaxing. Nothing in the shot says he is looking at anything with any kind of expectation.</td>', 'Good closeup. Unfortunately he looks like he is just relaxing. Nothing in the shot says he is looking at anything with any kind of expectation.', '2004-03-10 10:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
