(616610, 63689, 13136, '<td valign="top">I like the color and contrast in this shot. The focus on the subject needs a little sharpening. It''s not real easy to see the challenge, but it comes through with a little effort. Is that a penis hat?</td>', 'I like the color and contrast in this shot. The focus on the subject needs a little sharpening. It''s not real easy to see the challenge, but it comes through with a little effort. Is that a penis hat?', '2004-03-10 10:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
