(616619, 63876, 11738, '<td valign="top">Bizarro image.  What the hell is going on here?  Did you guys drop the cat or what.  This image makes no sense whatsoever.  Perspective makes the flying cat look HUGE!  Definitely weird...</td>', 'Bizarro image.  What the hell is going on here?  Did you guys drop the cat or what.  This image makes no sense whatsoever.  Perspective makes the flying cat look HUGE!  Definitely weird...', '2004-03-10 10:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
