(616802, 63929, 15919, '<td valign="top">Its pinsharp, nice colors and not at least a beautiful and healthy looking fellow you´ve got there.  What I´m saying: this is a good image.  BUT it doesnt fire up my imagination about whats of-screan wich makes it hard for me to rate it.  Well we´ll see .........</td>', 'Its pinsharp, nice colors and not at least a beautiful and healthy looking fellow you´ve got there.  What I´m saying: this is a good image.  BUT it doesnt fire up my imagination about whats of-screan wich makes it hard for me to rate it.  Well we´ll see .........', '2004-03-10 13:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(616803, 63600, 15919, '<td valign="top">At least I start wondering whats of-screan.  I asume that you are having difficult lightning conditions there but I think it´s not very well exposed.</td>', 'At least I start wondering whats of-screan.  I asume that you are having difficult lightning conditions there but I think it´s not very well exposed.', '2004-03-10 13:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(616804, 63814, 9448, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  I really like the composition of this picture the way that the triangle that the kid forms leads straight into the ball.  That leaves the rest of the frame which again is a triangle.  The lines of these shapes also create a dynamic which is reinforced by the off centre composition -- very effective.<br/> <br/>My biggest gripe with this picture is the artefacts that you can see on the boys skin, if you look closely you will see quite a few of them.  I am not sure if these are JPEG artefacts or if you Neatimaged the picture, I would have thought however that they are probably JPEG artefacts.<br/> <br/>I would probably also prefer to have seen the car a little bit closer, but then again so what it''s still a good picture.</td>', 'Good idea.  I really like the composition of this picture the way that the triangle that the kid forms leads straight into the ball.  That leaves the rest of the frame which again is a triangle.  The lines of these shapes also create a dynamic which is reinforced by the off centre composition -- very effective. My biggest gripe with this picture is the artefacts that you can see on the boys skin, if you look closely you will see quite a few of them.  I am not sure if these are JPEG artefacts or if you Neatimaged the picture, I would have thought however that they are probably JPEG artefacts. I would probably also prefer to have seen the car a little bit closer, but then again so what it''s still a good picture.', '2004-03-10 13:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(616808, 63384, 6667, '<td valign="top">WOW.</td>', 'WOW.', '2004-03-10 13:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(616810, 63727, 12252, '<td valign="top">Would NOT want to be the mouse... Good shot!</td>', 'Would NOT want to be the mouse... Good shot!', '2004-03-10 13:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(616811, 63936, 15832, '<td valign="top">It´s a realy good idea but you could have made it a lot cooler...</td>', 'It´s a realy good idea but you could have made it a lot cooler...', '2004-03-10 13:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(616813, 63813, 12252, '<td valign="top">Good reactions in this shot, although the lighting is rather flat. But it does make me wonder what are they looking at! Nice job!</td>', 'Good reactions in this shot, although the lighting is rather flat. But it does make me wonder what are they looking at! Nice job!', '2004-03-10 13:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(616814, 63963, 12252, '<td valign="top">I''m sure it''s staged, but nicely done. Not sure I like the noise, but I''m not sure I don''t like the noise.</td>', 'I''m sure it''s staged, but nicely done. Not sure I like the noise, but I''m not sure I don''t like the noise.', '2004-03-10 13:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(616816, 63871, 12252, '<td valign="top">Love the concept and the execution. My only problem is the rope looks too puny. Isn''t that odd? I wish you had used a thicker rope. Otherwise, I have only good things to say -- composition is excellent. Focus (especially on hands) is just a scosh (sp?) soft but that''s a nit.</td>', 'Love the concept and the execution. My only problem is the rope looks too puny. Isn''t that odd? I wish you had used a thicker rope. Otherwise, I have only good things to say -- composition is excellent. Focus (especially on hands) is just a scosh (sp?) soft but that''s a nit.', '2004-03-10 13:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(616818, 63575, 12252, '<td valign="top">Cute, funny. Lighting is a bit off but its challenging with the white shower curtain behind the subject. Good expression! Meets the challenge, too.</td>', 'Cute, funny. Lighting is a bit off but its challenging with the white shower curtain behind the subject. Good expression! Meets the challenge, too.', '2004-03-10 13:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(616820, 63889, 12252, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but I think you have too much negative space, particularly to the left of the subject. The background doesn''t appeal to me (the blur). The subject is a tad overexposed on the left arm, but the position is good (I like the lean) and the strap or rope going upward is a good idea. Just crop off that left side, okay? &lt;g&gt;</td>', 'Good idea, but I think you have too much negative space, particularly to the left of the subject. The background doesn''t appeal to me (the blur). The subject is a tad overexposed on the left arm, but the position is good (I like the lean) and the strap or rope going upward is a good idea. Just crop off that left side, okay? <g>', '2004-03-10 13:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(616823, 63999, 12252, '<td valign="top">P-K4! Good picture in terms of meeting the challenge. Not too thrilled with the soft focus or the noise, but I LOVE the expression of the model.</td>', 'P-K4! Good picture in terms of meeting the challenge. Not too thrilled with the soft focus or the noise, but I LOVE the expression of the model.', '2004-03-10 13:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(616828, 63133, 12252, '<td valign="top">Clearly meets the challenge. Hot spots on the nose, lips. Focus seems just a tad soft which isn''t helping your image. Well cropped IMO. The chain (?) below her chin is distracting.</td>', 'Clearly meets the challenge. Hot spots on the nose, lips. Focus seems just a tad soft which isn''t helping your image. Well cropped IMO. The chain (?) below her chin is distracting.', '2004-03-10 13:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(616830, 63890, 12252, '<td valign="top">I like your concept, with a few "buts," of course. The "model" doesn''t look like a model in the jeans. Plus he/she is either leaning, or your horizon is slanted. The bits of stuff in the grass near the model are distracting. I like where you placed the photographer and his position, but I would have either not cropped his head, or I would have cropped more off the right. Mainly, get that model looking like a model and standing straight! As he/she is right now, not terribly compelling...</td>', 'I like your concept, with a few "buts," of course. The "model" doesn''t look like a model in the jeans. Plus he/she is either leaning, or your horizon is slanted. The bits of stuff in the grass near the model are distracting. I like where you placed the photographer and his position, but I would have either not cropped his head, or I would have cropped more off the right. Mainly, get that model looking like a model and standing straight! As he/she is right now, not terribly compelling...', '2004-03-10 13:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(616831, 63987, 15832, '<td valign="top">That´s really cool and i´m giving you a 9 because this is very diffrent and creative,  but you have to tell me how you did that???</td>', 'That´s really cool and i´m giving you a 9 because this is very diffrent and creative,  but you have to tell me how you did that???', '2004-03-10 13:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(616832, 63453, 6667, '<td valign="top">Great, great capture. I love the intense concentration on something.  Image is way too soft though and grainy.  Lacks some sharp contrast.</td>', 'Great, great capture. I love the intense concentration on something.  Image is way too soft though and grainy.  Lacks some sharp contrast.', '2004-03-10 13:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(616835, 63373, 6667, '<td valign="top">Did I miss something?  Or is the fourh one the waiter?  Cute shot. BOL</td>', 'Did I miss something?  Or is the fourh one the waiter?  Cute shot. BOL', '2004-03-10 13:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(616838, 63898, 15919, '<td valign="top">You dont have to make your imagination fly to heaven to predicts whats ofscrean.  I think its a litle underexposed and needs a litle more colorsaturation.</td>', 'You dont have to make your imagination fly to heaven to predicts whats ofscrean.  I think its a litle underexposed and needs a litle more colorsaturation.', '2004-03-10 13:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(616840, 63725, 15832, '<td valign="top">Must be a boring game.Nice pic though</td>', 'Must be a boring game.Nice pic though', '2004-03-10 13:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(616841, 63727, 15832, '<td valign="top">Is that thing stuffed??Good capture if not.</td>', 'Is that thing stuffed??Good capture if not.', '2004-03-10 13:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(616843, 63727, 15919, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  I would have like to see the eye more closeup (or more croping) and at closer angel and the eye has to be pinsharp, the rest doesent matter.  Lilte more colorsaturation, probably not more contrast since the burned out background.  Maybe B/W</td>', 'Good idea.  I would have like to see the eye more closeup (or more croping) and at closer angel and the eye has to be pinsharp, the rest doesent matter.  Lilte more colorsaturation, probably not more contrast since the burned out background.  Maybe B/W', '2004-03-10 13:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(616846, 63887, 15919, '<td valign="top">I asume that you are shooting this with high ISO in difficult lightning condition.  Bit grainy and dull colors.  More colorsaturation and have you tried to convert it to B/W?</td>', 'I asume that you are shooting this with high ISO in difficult lightning condition.  Bit grainy and dull colors.  More colorsaturation and have you tried to convert it to B/W?', '2004-03-10 13:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(616848, 63944, 15919, '<td valign="top">Focusing on the eyes, thats important.  Also they have a beautiful color.  This one also wakens up your imagination (seems not to be that many in this challenge).</td>', 'Focusing on the eyes, thats important.  Also they have a beautiful color.  This one also wakens up your imagination (seems not to be that many in this challenge).', '2004-03-10 13:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(616850, 63198, 15832, '<td valign="top">Good job. I can feel the fear in this one...  9</td>', 'Good job. I can feel the fear in this one...  9', '2004-03-10 13:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(616852, 63894, 15919, '<td valign="top">Comic and good setup, sharp and well focused.</td>', 'Comic and good setup, sharp and well focused.', '2004-03-10 13:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(616857, 63887, 4008, '<td valign="top">I really like this one, a good expression, they have done this so many times. Waiting for the audience to come out. Image is slightly tilted to the left.</td>', 'I really like this one, a good expression, they have done this so many times. Waiting for the audience to come out. Image is slightly tilted to the left.', '2004-03-10 13:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(616860, 63981, 4008, '<td valign="top">the reflection in the glass really adds to this picture.</td>', 'the reflection in the glass really adds to this picture.', '2004-03-10 14:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(616861, 63929, 14620, '<td valign="top">This looks like baby Samuel and as cute as ever! :)  Great shot, great colors, cute expression and good lighting.  He''s probably got one of the best baby photo albums out there. :)</td>', 'This looks like baby Samuel and as cute as ever! :)  Great shot, great colors, cute expression and good lighting.  He''s probably got one of the best baby photo albums out there. :)', '2004-03-10 14:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(616862, 63586, 14620, '<td valign="top">Bound to be a winner, at least it is in my book anyways. :)  I love it!  Just wish I could see more of the expression on his face but what are ya gonna do?  It''s still wonderful, nice compostion and a great capture.</td>', 'Bound to be a winner, at least it is in my book anyways. :)  I love it!  Just wish I could see more of the expression on his face but what are ya gonna do?  It''s still wonderful, nice compostion and a great capture.', '2004-03-10 14:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(616863, 63880, 14620, '<td valign="top">Excellent!  I love the composition and especially the b&amp;w treatment you did on this.  It''s really amazing.  I think it suits the challenge very well. Nice job!</td>', 'Excellent!  I love the composition and especially the b&w treatment you did on this.  It''s really amazing.  I think it suits the challenge very well. Nice job!', '2004-03-10 14:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(616864, 63266, 14620, '<td valign="top">Excellent!  I get a great feeling from this photo.  I love his expression and overall appearance.  Fits the challenge nicely.</td>', 'Excellent!  I get a great feeling from this photo.  I love his expression and overall appearance.  Fits the challenge nicely.', '2004-03-10 14:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(616867, 63865, 17550, '<td valign="top">One big problem: I can see the camera reflected in the eye</td>', 'One big problem: I can see the camera reflected in the eye', '2004-03-10 14:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(616868, 63900, 14620, '<td valign="top">The vibrant color of this photo just screams at me.  I love it!  And the little wisps of blonde hair, it''s just too cute.  very nice lighting and good composition for what you are trying to convey, not sure if it captures an off-screen expectation, but doesn''t really matter if I get it, cause I really like the photo.</td>', 'The vibrant color of this photo just screams at me.  I love it!  And the little wisps of blonde hair, it''s just too cute.  very nice lighting and good composition for what you are trying to convey, not sure if it captures an off-screen expectation, but doesn''t really matter if I get it, cause I really like the photo.', '2004-03-10 14:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(616870, 63689, 12475, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful; what a great expression (and insane hat!). I like the colors, composition, humor, and it fits the challenge--woo hoo!</td>', 'This is wonderful; what a great expression (and insane hat!). I like the colors, composition, humor, and it fits the challenge--woo hoo!', '2004-03-10 14:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
