(616873, 63586, 17550, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Although I think my love of football (aka soccer) might make me slightly biased. A 10 ;)</td>', 'Beautiful. Although I think my love of football (aka soccer) might make me slightly biased. A 10 ;)', '2004-03-10 14:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
