(616935, 63969, 17550, '<td valign="top">One problem with the title here -- the expectation implies that the subject or photographer is about to find out something. Anger implies that it has already been found out, and thus there is no expectation left</td>', 'One problem with the title here -- the expectation implies that the subject or photographer is about to find out something. Anger implies that it has already been found out, and thus there is no expectation left', '2004-03-10 15:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
