(617275, 63439, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice interpretation of the challenge.  It looks as though the player in the foreground is just about to kick the ball (if this was soccer....it''s rugby, right?).  Colors and focus are great.</td>', 'Nice interpretation of the challenge.  It looks as though the player in the foreground is just about to kick the ball (if this was soccer....it''s rugby, right?).  Colors and focus are great.', '2004-03-10 17:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
