(617605, 63831, 16829, '<td valign="top">Good intensity, nicely framed. The monochromatic treatment makes it happen.</td>', 'Good intensity, nicely framed. The monochromatic treatment makes it happen.', '2004-03-10 23:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(617606, 63993, 16829, '<td valign="top">Good capture; a lot of energy coming through.</td>', 'Good capture; a lot of energy coming through.', '2004-03-10 23:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(617608, 63796, 16829, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Good lighting, not too hot. I like it cropped down to one predominant color range.</td>', 'Nicely done. Good lighting, not too hot. I like it cropped down to one predominant color range.', '2004-03-10 23:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(617609, 63738, 16829, '<td valign="top">Sorry, i''m not getting it. Lighting is washing everything out. I don''t see a reason to be interested in the subject.</td>', 'Sorry, i''m not getting it. Lighting is washing everything out. I don''t see a reason to be interested in the subject.', '2004-03-10 23:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(617610, 63964, 10799, '<td valign="top">Oh, my!  This is so pixalated.  If you meant to do this ok... but if you need help making your photo the right size there are many who will help you learn how to do this...either that or I need a brand new monitor  :)  Seriously, I would be happy to help if you need it.</td>', 'Oh, my!  This is so pixalated.  If you meant to do this ok... but if you need help making your photo the right size there are many who will help you learn how to do this...either that or I need a brand new monitor  :)  Seriously, I would be happy to help if you need it.', '2004-03-10 23:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(617611, 63468, 16829, '<td valign="top">I like it even better coming back to it.</td>', 'I like it even better coming back to it.', '2004-03-10 23:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(617613, 63842, 16829, '<td valign="top">Its ok, but doesn''t seem to convey any movement. The back lighting and whiteout at the top is unfortuneate. But I see what you were going for and points for that!</td>', 'Its ok, but doesn''t seem to convey any movement. The back lighting and whiteout at the top is unfortuneate. But I see what you were going for and points for that!', '2004-03-10 23:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(617615, 63780, 16829, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I don''t get it! Bottom half is dull color, upper half is a mess.</td>', 'Sorry, I don''t get it! Bottom half is dull color, upper half is a mess.', '2004-03-10 23:22:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(617623, 63843, 16829, '<td valign="top">Would have been better without the frame. Cuts too much of your subject for no good visual reason. I like the lighting and the composition.</td>', 'Would have been better without the frame. Cuts too much of your subject for no good visual reason. I like the lighting and the composition.', '2004-03-10 23:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(617624, 63767, 10799, '<td valign="top">I think the background keeps this photo from being a really good one... it is a bit distracting from the focus... it keeps the viewers eyes going in both directions instead of freely following the leading lines of her arms to the off camera compelling object.  Other than that the composition is very good.  Give my compliments to your model.  She did a great job holding still for you!</td>', 'I think the background keeps this photo from being a really good one... it is a bit distracting from the focus... it keeps the viewers eyes going in both directions instead of freely following the leading lines of her arms to the off camera compelling object.  Other than that the composition is very good.  Give my compliments to your model.  She did a great job holding still for you!', '2004-03-10 23:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(617625, 63880, 16829, '<td valign="top">too contrasty. No detail in the brassiere so center frame has no interest. The pose and framing seem too static. I''m not feeling the warm!</td>', 'too contrasty. No detail in the brassiere so center frame has no interest. The pose and framing seem too static. I''m not feeling the warm!', '2004-03-10 23:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(617626, 63453, 6804, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful work! <br/>I love the soft focus and the light grain in this. <br/>The angle of the rail, the expressions and the color tone all help to make this more than just another photograph. A fine work of art!  10</td>', 'This is beautiful work! I love the soft focus and the light grain in this. The angle of the rail, the expressions and the color tone all help to make this more than just another photograph. A fine work of art!  10', '2004-03-10 23:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(617629, 63880, 16438, '<td valign="top">great idea  great pic  I liked that you looked at the challange from a slightly different angle</td>', 'great idea  great pic  I liked that you looked at the challange from a slightly different angle', '2004-03-11 00:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(617635, 63864, 13158, '<td valign="top">I think this is a fantastic and powerful image.  I don''t feel it quite fits this challenge though so I hadda take a point away :(</td>', 'I think this is a fantastic and powerful image.  I don''t feel it quite fits this challenge though so I hadda take a point away :(', '2004-03-11 00:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(617636, 63835, 13158, '<td valign="top">Incredible looking animals!!  Great shot, just want to look up to see what they are looking at.  Good luck on the challenge</td>', 'Incredible looking animals!!  Great shot, just want to look up to see what they are looking at.  Good luck on the challenge', '2004-03-11 00:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(617639, 63867, 12151, '<td valign="top">This isn''t the photo that best incites curiosity about the things beyond the frame.  But it''s still a very, very good photo, in terms of composition.  If anything, curiosity is drawn into the frame because of the elegance of it.</td>', 'This isn''t the photo that best incites curiosity about the things beyond the frame.  But it''s still a very, very good photo, in terms of composition.  If anything, curiosity is drawn into the frame because of the elegance of it.', '2004-03-11 00:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(617640, 63287, 12151, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.</td>', 'Nice composition.', '2004-03-11 00:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(617641, 63995, 12151, '<td valign="top">One of the better photos here, in terms of composition,  that also meets the challenge.  The overall hue is a bit too warm, though.</td>', 'One of the better photos here, in terms of composition,  that also meets the challenge.  The overall hue is a bit too warm, though.', '2004-03-11 00:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(617646, 63880, 12151, '<td valign="top">Very appropriate for a racy advertising campaign.  It has the look of Abercrombie &amp; Fitch -- whether or not that''s a good thing is up for debate, since sexual photos incite viewer reactions almost too easily.  Technically, and in terms of composition, this is an impressive photo.</td>', 'Very appropriate for a racy advertising campaign.  It has the look of Abercrombie & Fitch -- whether or not that''s a good thing is up for debate, since sexual photos incite viewer reactions almost too easily.  Technically, and in terms of composition, this is an impressive photo.', '2004-03-11 00:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(617650, 63729, 12151, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, and it also evokes curiosity about what''s beyond the frame better than many of the other animal photos in this challenge.  In terms of visual composition, wouldn''t change a thing.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, and it also evokes curiosity about what''s beyond the frame better than many of the other animal photos in this challenge.  In terms of visual composition, wouldn''t change a thing.', '2004-03-11 00:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
