(617678, 63332, 4008, '<td valign="top">So far the best animal shot in this challenge. This dog is really showing an expectation, a great pose, and an appealing combination of dog and background, with good lighting.</td>', 'So far the best animal shot in this challenge. This dog is really showing an expectation, a great pose, and an appealing combination of dog and background, with good lighting.', '2004-03-11 02:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
