(618440, 63876, 13152, '<td valign="top">Brilliant, surreal, with facinating confusion of scale.  Nearly as good as the  famous Salvador Dali cats and water shot. When the comp is over you might go back to this and clean it up to remove traces of flash highlights and shadow on the switchplate and door. I''d also be inclined to take out everything in the open doorway to leave a white rectangle. I''d also crop the right side of the frame to just include the switchplate. I''m tempted to have a go myself!</td>', 'Brilliant, surreal, with facinating confusion of scale.  Nearly as good as the  famous Salvador Dali cats and water shot. When the comp is over you might go back to this and clean it up to remove traces of flash highlights and shadow on the switchplate and door. I''d also be inclined to take out everything in the open doorway to leave a white rectangle. I''d also crop the right side of the frame to just include the switchplate. I''m tempted to have a go myself!', '2004-03-11 17:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
