(618826, 63266, 3087, '<td valign="top">A beautiful portrait though not one that makes me think about what is happening off-screen since his expression leads me to believe he is reliving memories from a less lonely time and not looking at his surroundings much at all. That may not be the case but it''s what the image suggests to me. I do like the image very much.</td>', 'A beautiful portrait though not one that makes me think about what is happening off-screen since his expression leads me to believe he is reliving memories from a less lonely time and not looking at his surroundings much at all. That may not be the case but it''s what the image suggests to me. I do like the image very much.', '2004-03-12 06:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(618827, 63841, 3087, '<td valign="top">Hooray! Another idea that doesn''t rely on faces expressing surprise, anger, shock, terror... this is a creative entry and I love the geometric composition - the blue semi-circle dissected by that strong horizontal line and then the asymmetrical match and flame. Wonderful!</td>', 'Hooray! Another idea that doesn''t rely on faces expressing surprise, anger, shock, terror... this is a creative entry and I love the geometric composition - the blue semi-circle dissected by that strong horizontal line and then the asymmetrical match and flame. Wonderful!', '2004-03-12 06:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
