(619115, 63586, 11248, '<td valign="top">Great fit to the challenge. May be too much lost spaces and would be better if the left hand of the receiver was not just in front of his face. Otherwise very good picture. -8<br/></td>', 'Great fit to the challenge. May be too much lost spaces and would be better if the left hand of the receiver was not just in front of his face. Otherwise very good picture. -8', '2004-03-12 12:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
