(619119, 63983, 2792, '<td valign="top">Good composition!  I like the use of noise in the photo, but maybe just a little too much.  Nice job anyways. =-)</td>', 'Good composition!  I like the use of noise in the photo, but maybe just a little too much.  Nice job anyways. =-)', '2004-03-12 12:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
