(619198, 63643, 15919, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image.  Focus, sharpness, DOF, ........ everything very well done and the model is very nice. You start wondering whats of screen, is it another person, the sunset?  At least its something that the girl likes.<br/> If there is something I should critiziese then I would have liked a litle warmer white balance but thats always matter of opinion.  Good example of how simple can be good.  One of the best in this challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful image.  Focus, sharpness, DOF, ........ everything very well done and the model is very nice. You start wondering whats of screen, is it another person, the sunset?  At least its something that the girl likes. If there is something I should critiziese then I would have liked a litle warmer white balance but thats always matter of opinion.  Good example of how simple can be good.  One of the best in this challenge.', '2004-03-12 14:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
