(620405, 63468, 15810, '<td valign="top">very nice shot. Well framed. Would have been easy to loose detail in the back of the pipers legs due to the shadow and the bright pavement but you havemanaged an extremely tricky shot extremely well. I hope this is a high scorer. Well done.</td>', 'very nice shot. Well framed. Would have been easy to loose detail in the back of the pipers legs due to the shadow and the bright pavement but you havemanaged an extremely tricky shot extremely well. I hope this is a high scorer. Well done.', '2004-03-14 05:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(620406, 63981, 15810, '<td valign="top">I''ve looked and looked at this so please tell me, is the reflection in the glass fake coz it looks like it? if not great shot, weird reflection.</td>', 'I''ve looked and looked at this so please tell me, is the reflection in the glass fake coz it looks like it? if not great shot, weird reflection.', '2004-03-14 05:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(620475, 63317, 9504, '<td valign="top">This picture has a lot of emotion to it.  It is quite beautiful the message it gives about the loyalty of a friend.  I love it, though it breaks my heart.  The dogs look well cared for though which is great.  I just don''t know what the off-screen expectation is...forgive me.  I also would have cropped it much closer than you did.</td>', 'This picture has a lot of emotion to it.  It is quite beautiful the message it gives about the loyalty of a friend.  I love it, though it breaks my heart.  The dogs look well cared for though which is great.  I just don''t know what the off-screen expectation is...forgive me.  I also would have cropped it much closer than you did.', '2004-03-14 10:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(620476, 63575, 9504, '<td valign="top">You have a good sense of humor!  : )</td>', 'You have a good sense of humor!  : )', '2004-03-14 10:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(620477, 63453, 9504, '<td valign="top">There is a real artist quality about this photo that is precious.  Very nice job.</td>', 'There is a real artist quality about this photo that is precious.  Very nice job.', '2004-03-14 10:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(620479, 63813, 9504, '<td valign="top">Really nice capture of emotions.  Great job.</td>', 'Really nice capture of emotions.  Great job.', '2004-03-14 10:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(620480, 63929, 9504, '<td valign="top">He doesn''t appear to be looking at anything off screen.  He looks rather relaxed, happy and content -- almost as if he is about to fall asleep.  He looks like a chip-off the old block!  Sweet photo...</td>', 'He doesn''t appear to be looking at anything off screen.  He looks rather relaxed, happy and content -- almost as if he is about to fall asleep.  He looks like a chip-off the old block!  Sweet photo...', '2004-03-14 10:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(620482, 63863, 9504, '<td valign="top">What a sweet dog.  I would have cropped this closer or taken the picture much closer to the dog.  There is too much empty space around him and the photo isn''t the most clear.</td>', 'What a sweet dog.  I would have cropped this closer or taken the picture much closer to the dog.  There is too much empty space around him and the photo isn''t the most clear.', '2004-03-14 10:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(620483, 63786, 9504, '<td valign="top">There is too much space around the dogs, and not enough view of them to make this photo enticing.  Don''t give up -- your friends look so adorable.  I just want to see more of them : )</td>', 'There is too much space around the dogs, and not enough view of them to make this photo enticing.  Don''t give up -- your friends look so adorable.  I just want to see more of them : )', '2004-03-14 10:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(620484, 63945, 9504, '<td valign="top">Very clever photo.  Quite impressive.  Great job.  Truly unique and well thought out.</td>', 'Very clever photo.  Quite impressive.  Great job.  Truly unique and well thought out.', '2004-03-14 10:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
