(620490, 63426, 9504, '<td valign="top">WOW.  This is incredible.  It steals the show in many regards!  Very, very nice capture.  One of my favorites!!!</td>', 'WOW.  This is incredible.  It steals the show in many regards!  Very, very nice capture.  One of my favorites!!!', '2004-03-14 10:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
