(620524, 63749, 5822, '<td valign="top">Very difficult lighting situation to shoot under with the mix of natural outdoor and incandenscent indoor lighting. Left side of photo has a yellow/green tint to it. In addition, there appears alot of noise that''s degrading picture quality.</td>', 'Very difficult lighting situation to shoot under with the mix of natural outdoor and incandenscent indoor lighting. Left side of photo has a yellow/green tint to it. In addition, there appears alot of noise that''s degrading picture quality.', '2004-03-14 11:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(620534, 63575, 12809, '<td valign="top">OMG!  This is SO incredibly funny!  This has got to win - at least place.  <br/> <br/>Love the facial expression, it totally makes the shot!  One thing that this photo has that the others usually lack, is that you can understand what the photo is about WITHOUT seeing the title.  LOL  Too darn funny!  Awesome job.</td>', 'OMG!  This is SO incredibly funny!  This has got to win - at least place.   Love the facial expression, it totally makes the shot!  One thing that this photo has that the others usually lack, is that you can understand what the photo is about WITHOUT seeing the title.  LOL  Too darn funny!  Awesome job.', '2004-03-14 12:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(620535, 63426, 12809, '<td valign="top">Hahaha, this is really funny!  He looks like a conductor!  Amazing capture.</td>', 'Hahaha, this is really funny!  He looks like a conductor!  Amazing capture.', '2004-03-14 12:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(620536, 63474, 12809, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract.  Looking at this I wouldn''t know it was smoke...but...going by your title, it does make me wonder what may have caused the smoke.  I''m giving this a 7 because I like it.  Seems a bit dark in the lower half - maybe play with levels a bit.  Nice job.</td>', 'Interesting abstract.  Looking at this I wouldn''t know it was smoke...but...going by your title, it does make me wonder what may have caused the smoke.  I''m giving this a 7 because I like it.  Seems a bit dark in the lower half - maybe play with levels a bit.  Nice job.', '2004-03-14 12:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(620537, 63737, 12809, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure why someone would have thought this was PS''d (I see it''s been validated).  This is a cool shot even though it gives me goosebumps!  Nice work, and good DOF.</td>', 'I''m not sure why someone would have thought this was PS''d (I see it''s been validated).  This is a cool shot even though it gives me goosebumps!  Nice work, and good DOF.', '2004-03-14 12:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(620538, 63227, 12809, '<td valign="top">Love this.  Works well in b&amp;w and certainly has me wondering what may be inside.  Good work.</td>', 'Love this.  Works well in b&w and certainly has me wondering what may be inside.  Good work.', '2004-03-14 12:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(620539, 63384, 12809, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, and I DO wonder what he''s going to photograph.<br/> <br/>Gosh, who wouldn''t kill for that set-up??</td>', 'Nice shot, and I DO wonder what he''s going to photograph. Gosh, who wouldn''t kill for that set-up??', '2004-03-14 12:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(620544, 63613, 12809, '<td valign="top">Terrific shot!  Great dof, like the sepia tone.  Most of all I like the crop!<br/> <br/>My second 10...congrats. :-)</td>', 'Terrific shot!  Great dof, like the sepia tone.  Most of all I like the crop! My second 10...congrats. :-)', '2004-03-14 12:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(620547, 63867, 12809, '<td valign="top">Bumping this from an 8 to a 9...  I really, really like this shot.  It''s kind of abstract with the way that it''s cropped, the way they all face the same way, and the curves of their horns.  It may just be because of the resizing, but it looks to me like the focus was on the middle gazelle (?) because the two to either side appear a bit softer - just wish they were equally in focus.<br/> <br/>Super job!</td>', 'Bumping this from an 8 to a 9...  I really, really like this shot.  It''s kind of abstract with the way that it''s cropped, the way they all face the same way, and the curves of their horns.  It may just be because of the resizing, but it looks to me like the focus was on the middle gazelle (?) because the two to either side appear a bit softer - just wish they were equally in focus. Super job!', '2004-03-14 12:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(620568, 63810, 18191, '<td valign="top">I like the shot---you got a 7 from me---but if that guy, who seems to be in peril, is really in peril, his stance is not believable...Good idea though!</td>', 'I like the shot---you got a 7 from me---but if that guy, who seems to be in peril, is really in peril, his stance is not believable...Good idea though!', '2004-03-14 13:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
