(624284, 63876, 11432, '<td valign="top">Thanks all for commenting on my photo, I really had fun with this one and reading the comments<br/>Here is how I did it. <a href="//www.agapecomputerservices.com/dpchallenge.cfm" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.agapecomputerservices.com/dpchallenge.cfm</a></td>', 'Thanks all for commenting on my photo, I really had fun with this one and reading the commentsHere is how I did it. //www.agapecomputerservices.com/dpchallenge.cfm', '2004-03-17 00:02:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(624294, 63880, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely beautifully done... Congrats on the ribbon... I haven''t voted anytime recently... but this photo made me sit up and say wow.  VERY well done.  Your tonal ranges for black and white are awesome, and I love the balance of the photo, as well as the use of blank space.  Great interpretation of the challenge, a very sexy photo overall, could easily be an ad for something, perhaps jeans?  I also like your use of lighting, someone thought it was harsh shadows, but I think it gives an edge to this photo, which is not meant to be soft, edgy and sexy.  I love it... great job!</td>', 'This is absolutely beautifully done... Congrats on the ribbon... I haven''t voted anytime recently... but this photo made me sit up and say wow.  VERY well done.  Your tonal ranges for black and white are awesome, and I love the balance of the photo, as well as the use of blank space.  Great interpretation of the challenge, a very sexy photo overall, could easily be an ad for something, perhaps jeans?  I also like your use of lighting, someone thought it was harsh shadows, but I think it gives an edge to this photo, which is not meant to be soft, edgy and sexy.  I love it... great job!', '2004-03-17 00:10:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(624297, 63880, 327, '<td valign="top">Congrats. I''m so glad to see your still around with us Miss Parker. I enjoy your work.<br/>Way to go!!</td>', 'Congrats. I''m so glad to see your still around with us Miss Parker. I enjoy your work.Way to go!!', '2004-03-17 00:11:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(624301, 63800, 14476, '<td valign="top">This is a charming picture.  I voted it high and wish it had done better.  He will treasure this one when he grows up.</td>', 'This is a charming picture.  I voted it high and wish it had done better.  He will treasure this one when he grows up.', '2004-03-17 00:12:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(624310, 63994, 17724, '<td valign="top">Thank you to those who commented.   I came up with the idea and tried it right before the challenge deadline.  Technically, this is a poor photograph, I think the model needs to either be in focus or more out of focus, and I never did get a drip of wax falling off the candle.  The model was supposed to be looking down below the candle in expectation of what was about to happen off screen.  I decided at the last second to submit it to see what people thought about it fitting the challenge.  Interestingly, I got almost equal comments both ways.</td>', 'Thank you to those who commented.   I came up with the idea and tried it right before the challenge deadline.  Technically, this is a poor photograph, I think the model needs to either be in focus or more out of focus, and I never did get a drip of wax falling off the candle.  The model was supposed to be looking down below the candle in expectation of what was about to happen off screen.  I decided at the last second to submit it to see what people thought about it fitting the challenge.  Interestingly, I got almost equal comments both ways.', '2004-03-17 00:14:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(624318, 63762, 17037, '<td valign="top">Nice Job Gary!  I think the sharpness of Lyndsey and her very clear, sharp eyes really make this picture.  Hallie further back add nicely, and I like that there is no confusing background.</td>', 'Nice Job Gary!  I think the sharpness of Lyndsey and her very clear, sharp eyes really make this picture.  Hallie further back add nicely, and I like that there is no confusing background.', '2004-03-17 00:16:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(624322, 63945, 13688, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments.  Unfortunately I didn''t have enough time to write something before the competition started.  I probably was much more excited right after I took it, before the scores started coming in.  Interesting how many people hated it or I''m assuming didn''t think it met the challenge.  I''m glad most who commented liked the angle and composition.  It will help me to continue to look at stuff from a fresh perspective.  Thanks to Jess for not chugging her martini and putting up with the picture taking even after it passed the "fun" stage.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-03-22 23:31:21.</i></td>', 'Thanks for the comments.  Unfortunately I didn''t have enough time to write something before the competition started.  I probably was much more excited right after I took it, before the scores started coming in.  Interesting how many people hated it or I''m assuming didn''t think it met the challenge.  I''m glad most who commented liked the angle and composition.  It will help me to continue to look at stuff from a fresh perspective.  Thanks to Jess for not chugging her martini and putting up with the picture taking even after it passed the "fun" stage.', '2004-03-17 00:17:55.000000', '2004-03-22 23:31:21.000000', 0),
(624330, 63727, 17037, '<td valign="top">For folks who questioned this picture (is the bird stuffed?) .. it was not.  Very live and very active.  Taken at the Wild Animal Park in San Diego with a 450 mm lens on a very bright day from a distance of about 60 feet<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-03-17 00:27:15.</i></td>', 'For folks who questioned this picture (is the bird stuffed?) .. it was not.  Very live and very active.  Taken at the Wild Animal Park in San Diego with a 450 mm lens on a very bright day from a distance of about 60 feet', '2004-03-17 00:18:55.000000', '2004-03-17 00:27:15.000000', 0),
(624346, 63331, 1280, '<td valign="top">Hi!  I''m really surprised this didn''t score better.  You did a fine job here.  Just keep doing what you love, and don''t get hung up on scores.  <br/>Best of luck!<br/>Grayce</td>', 'Hi!  I''m really surprised this didn''t score better.  You did a fine job here.  Just keep doing what you love, and don''t get hung up on scores.  Best of luck!Grayce', '2004-03-17 00:21:42.000000', NULL, 0),
