(625196, 63344, 16097, '<td valign="top">Hey all, thanks for the comments on my first submission... The focus issues are right on target. <br/> <br/>This was the only photo from my day at the museum that really fit the challenge, it was a candid shot of about 8 tourists that I cropped down to just the two faces you see. <br/> <br/>Its amazing the wonder people feel in watching airplanes take flight...<br/> <br/>Thanks again,<br/>Mark</td>', 'Hey all, thanks for the comments on my first submission... The focus issues are right on target.  This was the only photo from my day at the museum that really fit the challenge, it was a candid shot of about 8 tourists that I cropped down to just the two faces you see.  Its amazing the wonder people feel in watching airplanes take flight... Thanks again,Mark', '2004-03-17 09:32:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(625222, 63912, 5792, '<td valign="top">There may be a couple minor hot spots, but this is a fantastic image and was one of my top three choices for this challenge. You did a great job. My hat is off to you.</td>', 'There may be a couple minor hot spots, but this is a fantastic image and was one of my top three choices for this challenge. You did a great job. My hat is off to you.', '2004-03-17 10:04:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(625256, 63867, 7969, '<td valign="top">this was one of my favorite shots of the challenge I would love it if you told us where how shot it, how did you get white background?</td>', 'this was one of my favorite shots of the challenge I would love it if you told us where how shot it, how did you get white background?', '2004-03-17 10:27:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(625263, 63787, 5792, '<td valign="top">This is simply one fantastic, flawless image. It fits the challenge topic perfectly and it is a technically superior picture. It is the best image in the challenge and was easily in my top three picks. Congratulations on a great photograph.</td>', 'This is simply one fantastic, flawless image. It fits the challenge topic perfectly and it is a technically superior picture. It is the best image in the challenge and was easily in my top three picks. Congratulations on a great photograph.', '2004-03-17 10:31:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(625274, 63796, 5792, '<td valign="top">Steinar... A very fine portrait. For your youth you have great talent. Something tells me we will be seeing a lot of ribbons on your profile page as you continue to participate.</td>', 'Steinar... A very fine portrait. For your youth you have great talent. Something tells me we will be seeing a lot of ribbons on your profile page as you continue to participate.', '2004-03-17 10:39:39.000000', NULL, 0),
