(630768, 63586, 9884, '<td valign="top">GREAT SHOT...it is as you had them pose...to perfect of a shot for that!! GOOD JOB!!<br/></td>', 'GREAT SHOT...it is as you had them pose...to perfect of a shot for that!! GOOD JOB!!', '2004-03-22 00:29:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(630779, 63586, 9884, '<td valign="top">I need to add..Great facial expressions captured...feet off the ground...intertwined w/the other player...EXCELLENT SHOT!!!!</td>', 'I need to add..Great facial expressions captured...feet off the ground...intertwined w/the other player...EXCELLENT SHOT!!!!', '2004-03-22 00:31:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(630888, 63880, 6349, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your first ribbon.  Now that you got a ribbon and you''ve4 entered 50 challenges, why not take the time to get involved a bit more on the site.  Make some comments, add some stuff to your favorites.  Make some friends.  Your work is excellent I am sure many people would love some help from you.</td>', 'Congrats on your first ribbon.  Now that you got a ribbon and you''ve4 entered 50 challenges, why not take the time to get involved a bit more on the site.  Make some comments, add some stuff to your favorites.  Make some friends.  Your work is excellent I am sure many people would love some help from you.', '2004-03-22 01:35:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(632422, 63526, 7438, '<td valign="top">So you must''ve seen it too. The skies of Hafnarfjordur are swarming with these damned things. Ridiculous.</td>', 'So you must''ve seen it too. The skies of Hafnarfjordur are swarming with these damned things. Ridiculous.', '2004-03-22 19:39:39.000000', NULL, 0),
