(633480, 63349, 6202, '<td valign="top">Critique Club<br/> <br/>What a cute little girl very charming photo.  Definately fits the challenges.  Makes you wonder what she is looking at.  <br/> <br/>There are two things that could be done to improve it.  First left side of her face appears to get soft.  The other thing is the throw in the background it appears to be a wolf face, is very distracting and takes away from her.<br/> <br/>Again it is very nice work just has those two minor flaws to it.<br/> <br/>Anna</td>', 'Critique Club What a cute little girl very charming photo.  Definately fits the challenges.  Makes you wonder what she is looking at.   There are two things that could be done to improve it.  First left side of her face appears to get soft.  The other thing is the throw in the background it appears to be a wolf face, is very distracting and takes away from her. Again it is very nice work just has those two minor flaws to it. Anna', '2004-03-23 13:17:55.000000', NULL, 0),
