(634326, 63848, 9668, '<td valign="top">[Critique Club]<br/>Composition - The background is distacting, it would have been better if had been blurred or replaced. Centered is good, but also normal. Size could have been bigger (up to 640 largest size).<br/> <br/>Technical Quality - I think this could have been edited to a higher quality. Lighting is good, could have been sharpened a little, contrast could have been boosted. Red eye could have been eliminated.<br/> <br/>Meets the Challenge - check.<br/> <br/>Creativity - Nice capture of the expression, funny.<br/> <br/>Overall - Funny picture, but could have had a higher quality.</td>', '[Critique Club]Composition - The background is distacting, it would have been better if had been blurred or replaced. Centered is good, but also normal. Size could have been bigger (up to 640 largest size). Technical Quality - I think this could have been edited to a higher quality. Lighting is good, could have been sharpened a little, contrast could have been boosted. Red eye could have been eliminated. Meets the Challenge - check. Creativity - Nice capture of the expression, funny. Overall - Funny picture, but could have had a higher quality.', '2004-03-24 00:10:27.000000', NULL, 0),
